  "summary": "MSUI has the full main action bar: 12 buttons with icon/cooldown swipe+flash/stack count/hotkey, usability tint, six pages, spell/item/macro/auto-attack kinds, action-button persistence, XP/rested state, and latency. Ranged auto-repeat re-press and Escape send the empty CMSG_CANCEL_AUTO_REPEAT_SPELL and strict SMSG cancellation clears the local flash/visual state. Inventory and mount/dismount refusals reach UIErrorsFrame through build-5875 GlobalStrings mappings. The persisted Lock ActionBars option and unbound toggle command now suppress drag-start and receive-drag on the main and pet bars while deliberately retaining the reference's Shift-click pickup path; existing bar geometry and presentation remain untouched.",
